<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <style>
      .title {
        display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      }
    </style>
    <div class="title">
      <h1>Our Very Best Compliance Potion For Uncooperative Employees</h1>
    </div>
    <style>
      .witches-inc {
        display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      }
    </style>
    <div class="witches-inc">
      <h2>Witches Incorporated<h2>
    </div>
    <p>Are your employees not turning princesses into frogs quickly enough for your liking? Are they demanding enough pay to feed their familiars? Are they, horror of horrors, insisting on a 32-hour work day? Well, as their supernatural employer, you have the legal right to administer a compliance potion! While some may complain of a lack of ethics, they can't argue with results! Go forth and lobotomize your underlings with this tried-and-true recipe!</p>
    <style>
      .ingredients {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-around;
        color: rebeccapurple;
        }
    </style>
    <div class="ingredients">
    <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/image-illustration/watercolor-potion-illustration-clipart-isolated-260nw-2515043283.jpg" 
    height="200">
    <div>
      <h3>Ingredients</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>13 frog eyeballs, ground into gel</li>
        <li>200ml jellyfish slime</li>
        <li>300ml ostrich tears
        <li>1 calf's worth of yak hair</li>
        <li>50ml powdered roof tiles from the home of an exploited labourer</li>
        <li>50ml water</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
      <img src="https://www.shutterstock.com/image-illustration/watercolor-potion-illustration-clipart-isolated-260nw-2515043283.jpg"
      height="200">
    </div>
    <style>
      .instructions {
       display: flex;
       justify-content: space-around;
        color: rebeccapurple;}
    </style>
    <div class="instructions">
      <div>
        <h3>Instructions</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Set your cauldron to high heat and combine your jellyfish slime and ostrich tears in it. Stir well.</li>
          <li>Put your yak's hair in a magical disintegrator, making sure to fully collect all of the dust.</li>
          <li>Once your mixture bubbles, stir again and add your yak's hair. It should not turn to gel or paste, but rather remain liquid.</li>
          <li>Gradually sprinkle in the powdered roof tiles, continuing to stir. At this point, the texture should be getting thicker.</li>
          <li>Finally, to bring your potion back to a liquid state, add water. Cool before serving to your employees.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <img src="https://png.pngtree.com/png-clipart/20231026/original/pngtree-witch-cauldron-with-potion-png-image_13445195.png" height="300">
    </div>
    <p>Now that you've drugged those pesky mutineers into mindless aquiescence with your every demand, consider taking a look at any of our other certified Witches Incorporated recipes!</p>
  </body>
